       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PAYMAIN.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-COUNTER PIC 9(05) VALUE ZERO.
       01 WS-STATUS  PIC X(10) VALUE SPACES.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-SECTION.
           DISPLAY "PAYMENT PROCESSING BATCH STARTED"
           PERFORM PROCESS-ITEMS
           DISPLAY "ITEMS PROCESSED: " WS-COUNTER
           DISPLAY "PAYMENT PROCESSING BATCH COMPLETED"
           MOVE 0 TO RETURN-CODE
           GOBACK.
       PROCESS-ITEMS.
           ADD 1 TO WS-COUNTER
           MOVE "DONE" TO WS-STATUS.
